{"id":"paper-search-live","i":0,"run":{"i":0,"reply":"B站... 不对，是论文这边——先跟你交个底：`paper-search` 那个 MCP 服务这会儿掉线了，我连了三次都是 `server is disconnected`，`mcp__paper-search__search_papers` 调不起来。\n\n我没干等着，绕去 arXiv 的公开接口抓了两篇回来（也算是出门觅食换了个摊位 🍜）：\n\n1. **Erasing Undesirable Influence in Diffusion Models**（2024，cs.CV）—— 讲扩散模型\"机器遗忘\"，把不想要的影响从模型里抹掉。\n2. **SF-MMCN: Low-Power Server Flow Multi-Mode Diffusion Model Accelerator**（2024，cs.AR）—— 扩散模型的低功耗硬件加速器。\n\n要不要我再跑一下？两个选择：\n- 你把 `paper-search` MCP 服务重启一下，我用原定工具重搜（能顺手带上 DOI/引用数这些）；\n- 或者我继续用 arXiv 接口，按你要的方向（比如图像生成、SDE、DDPM 这些）再挑更经典的几篇。\n\n你说一声就行～","tools":193,"toolNames":["astron_skillhub_check_availability","astron_skillhub_check_update","astron_skillhub_disable","astron_skillhub_enable","astron_skillhub_install","astron_skillhub_list_installed","astron_skillhub_operation","astron_skillhub_search","astron_skillhub_uninstall","astron_skillhub_upgrade","bili_comments","bili_config","bili_cover","bili_frames","bili_humanism_cancel","bili_humanism_candidates","bili_humanism_frames","bili_humanism_guide","bili_humanism_import","bili_humanism_inbox","bili_humanism_journal","bili_humanism_memory","bili_humanism_personality","bili_humanism_probe","bili_humanism_question","bili_humanism_read","bili_humanism_source","bili_humanism_status","bili_humanism_visual","bili_live_asr_probe","bili_live_audio_start","bili_live_audio_status","bili_live_audio_stop","bili_live_doctor","bili_live_feed","bili_live_info","bili_live_log","bili_live_request","bili_live_send","bili_live_transcript","bili_live_watch_start","bili_live_watch_status","bili_live_watch_stop","bili_live_watching","bili_login_poll","bili_login_start","bili_reply","bili_run","bili_search","bili_setup","bili_status","bili_subtitle","bili_whoami","desktop_control","desktop_sequence","drawio_render","drawio_template","drawio_validate","dsh_im_group_file","dsh_im_group_history","dsh_im_return_file","edit","edit_image","generate_image","generate_images","glob","grep","import_chat","interrupt_age